     "kind": "legal"
    }
   ],
   "assumptions": [
    "Boundary: documenting and verifying specimens; providing clinical data to pathologists (task 17398) is a sibling task.",
    "Coverage: s1 keeps 50 for senders without barcodes; s2 keeps 25 for paper forms; s3 keeps 30 for special vessels.",
